[2026-08-12] p_218 VERIFY sweep, part 2: audit complete across all 28 draft articles
  - Method: 5 parallel read-only audit agents (Two-Tier directors 8, early/mid people 7, notable alumni 5, chronology 5, programs/places/docs 3), each checking claims against directors-index.md, timeline-overview.md, the relevant topic articles, kb/facts.json and kb/conflicts.json. Agents were instructed to report only -- no edits, no web research, no new facts -- so all corrections stay under central review. Plus a mechanical harness (scripts/verify/) for the deterministic half.
