[2026-08-14] c_021 RESOLVED by operator account: the 2020 L&V Games were played remotely
  - Matt supplied the missing context: in the first COVID summer the L&V Games were played REMOTELY -- volunteer alumni and campers competing in individual and online challenges from within their socially-distanced "bubbles." The 2021 Games were not held. Reading (a) of the three offered when c_021 was raised was correct.
